Package: less
Version: 471-r0
Description: Text file viewer similar to more
 Less is a program similar to more, i.e. a terminal based program for
 viewing text files and the output from other programs. Less offers many
 features beyond those that more does.
Section: console/utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Poky <poky@yoctoproject.org>
License: GPLv3+ | BSD-2-Clause
Architecture: cortexa9-vfp-neon
OE: less
Homepage: http://www.greenwoodsoftware.com/
Depends: update-alternatives-opkg, libtinfo5 (>= 5.9), libc6 (>= 2.21)
Source: http://www.greenwoodsoftware.com/less/less-471.tar.gz file://0001-Fix-possible-buffer-overrun-with-invalid-UTF-8.patch
